  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration and Development Hub in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands is contributing to BMZ&apos;s Centers for Migration and Development in Egypt, which is implemented by GIZ. With the contribution of the Netherlands, a hub in Upper-Egypt will be opened. Here, the provision of technical and vocational training for Egyptians and Egyptian returnees will be provided, as well as efforts related to capacity building of partners. The establishment of this hub is in line with agreements made in the Declaration of Intent, signed between the Netherlands and Egypt in 2021.</narrative>
  </description>
